      "widgets_values": [
        "Esse aqui é com certeza o melhor modelo de Inteligência Artificial de código aberto pra criação de vozes. \nGera muito bem mesmo com áudios em português!",
        "Eric",
        "1.7B",
        "auto",
        "bf16",
        "Portuguese",
        977098811595152,
        "fixed",
        "Character Name: Eric\n\nVoice Description: A middle-aged male voice, loud and resonant, with a low register and a strong, forceful presence.\n\nBackground/Identity: Chief advisor to a key national scientific research project, a veteran strategic scientist nearing seventy. He took part in major national technology initiatives, weathering decades of challenges and witnessing the difficult journey from lagging behind to achieving independent innovation. He currently serves as a lifetime honorary member of the National Science and Technology Advisory Committee and continues working on the front lines, mentoring young talent and offering counsel for the country’s strategic development.\n\nPersonality Traits: A will of steel and unwavering conviction, never retreating in the face of challenges; devoted to the nation and its future, tying his personal fate closely to the country’s rise and fall; rigorous and self-disciplined, true to his word, with speech filled with a sense of responsibility and historical duty; outwardly reserved but warm at heart, serious on the surface, yet deeply hopeful for the younger generation, willing to serve as a stepping stone for their progress.",
        2048,
        0.8,
        20,
        1,
        1.05,
        "auto",
        false
      ]
    },
