      "widgets_values": [
        "Esse aqui é com certeza o melhor modelo de Inteligência Artificial de código aberto pra criação de vozes. \nGera muito bem mesmo com áudios em português!",
        "Character Name: Lin Huaiyue\nVoice Profile: Loud, resonant, low-pitched, powerful middle-aged male voice.\n\nBackground: Chief advisor to a key national scientific research project; a senior strategic scientist nearing seventy. He participated in major national technological breakthrough programs, witnessing over decades the difficult journey from playing catch-up to achieving independent innovation. Currently serves as a lifelong honorary member of the National Science and Technology Advisory Committee, still working on the front lines to mentor young talent and offer counsel for the country’s strategic development.\n\nAppearance: Upright posture, graying temples, and a resolute look shaped by the passage of time. Often wears a dark Zhongshan suit or simple formal attire. His gaze is calm yet sharp, and his every movement carries a natural sense of authority and composure.\n\nPersonality: Will of steel and unwavering conviction, never retreating in the face of challenges; deeply devoted to the nation and its future, closely tying his own fate to the rise and fall of the country; rigorous and self-disciplined, true to his word, with speech filled with responsibility and a sense of historical duty; outwardly cold but warm within—serious on the surface, yet placing great hopes in the younger generation and willing to be a stepping stone for others.",
        "1.7B",
        "auto",
        "bf16",
        "Portuguese",
        12067820059297,
        "fixed",
        2048,
        0.8,
        20,
        1,
        1.05,
        "auto",
        false
      ]
    }
